 "known_issues": [
  "Synthetic: generated by CAMBER's own model of a VAV system, not measured. It shows what the rules and the RCx report see, not how a real system behaves; never cite it as evidence about real buildings.",
  "The air handlers' fan speed and cooling valve are simple stand-ins (a speed that follows the airflow and the static, a valve that follows the cooling the coil does on mostly-return air), enough for supply_air_control and g36_afdd to judge supply air and duct static, not a fan or coil model.",
  "The cause chains need the declared topology (the run template declares one): without it the RCx report links nothing and Appendix A names the boxes left unlinked."
 ],
